        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: \"1979\"\n- Albums: Mellon Collie and the Infinite Sadness\n- Bands: The Smashing Pumpkins\n- People: Billy Corgan\n- Companies: Virgin Records\n\nFacts:\n- Mellon Collie and the Infinite Sadness is the third studio album by The Smashing Pumpkins.\n- Mellon Collie and the Infinite Sadness was released in the United Kingdom on October 23, 1995, and in the United States on October 24, 1995, by Virgin Records.\n- \"1979\" was released in 1996 as the second single from Mellon Collie and the Infinite Sadness.\n- Billy Corgan wrote \"1979\".\n- \"1979\" features loops and samples that were uncharacteristic of previous Smashing Pumpkins songs.",
